    "definition_raw": "You excel at hunting humans in the dead of night and murdering them quietly.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Skill Focus (Stealth), darkvision, half-ogre or ogre, size Large or larger.\n\nBenefit(s): While in areas of dim lighting or natural darkness, you ignore all size penalties on Stealth checks and gain a +2 bonus on attack rolls against flat-footed enemies.",
